cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource, please cite the survey below."
title: "Learning From Experience: A Lifecycle Survey of Memory, Skills, and Self-Evolution in Lifelong LLM Agents"
abstract: >-
  A survey that organizes the lifelong / self-evolving LLM-agent literature by
  the lifecycle of experience: an eight-stage pipeline (Acquisition,
  Representation, Retrieval, Consolidation, Abstraction, Internalization,
  Revision, Distribution) plus a cross-cutting Governance overlay.
